<title>CHILE: Codelco/AMP venture studies Ecuador, Mexico sites.</title>
<headline>Codelco/AMP venture studies Ecuador, Mexico sites.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inversiones Mineras Los Andes, a joint venture between Chile's state copper company Codelco and the Australian Mutual Provident Society (AMP), said it is to study copper and gold deposits in Ecuador and Mexico.</p>
<p>&quot;We are going to look at some offers of gold deposits in Ecuador to see if they are worth pursuing or not,&quot; Los Andes general manager Nicolas Saric told Reuters.</p>
<p>The properties in Ecuador include unexplored deposits and more advanced sites where drilling has been carried out, he said.</p>
</text>
